# Output produced by running the example scripts (figures and data dumps).
*.png
*.dat
# The legacy notebooks embed these three statically and nothing regenerates
# them, so they are required assets: without them a fresh clone cannot build the
# docs ("image file not readable"). QD_load and dot_transistor are drawings;
# RTD_2vN_comp1 is a pre-rendered comparison plot kept as a figure. Listed one by
# one on purpose, so that genuinely generated figures dropped into the same
# directory stay ignored.
!examples/legacy_tutorials/images/QD_load.png
!examples/legacy_tutorials/images/RTD_2vN_comp1.png
!examples/legacy_tutorials/images/dot_transistor.png

